{"aliases":["DINOv2"],"external_ids":{"arxiv":"2304.07193"},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-23T03:16:06.170012+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"expand: neighbors of diffusion, world model, CLIP, sim-to-real","op":"insert","reason":null,"run_id":"r_20261023_61gv9r"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:16:06.170012+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261023_61gv9r","expanded_at":null,"how":"先训练大规模视觉 Transformer，再蒸馏成一组较小的模型。","id":"n_01m5kc4deh8qgyrc19","importance":4,"kind":"method","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"DINOv2","name_zh":null,"occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-10-23T03:16:06.221923+00:00","slug":"dinov2","status":"active","summary":"只从图像自身学习、可冻结用于多种视觉任务的通用特征。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:16:06.170012+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261023_61gv9r","what":"在筛选并再平衡过的图像上做判别式自监督，使同一物体的不同视图和图像块对齐。","why":"图文预训练受标题限制，像素级结构常常进不了特征，而且还依赖配对文本。只从图像学习可以更接近语言那种无标注预训练，但数据又脏又偏时特征会变差。用相似度筛过的图像来放大自监督，才能得到不必微调的通用视觉特征。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.85,"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:16:06.170012+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m5kc4dgww22zhs70","other_id":"n_01m5gnvyxxjck30mv4","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"CLIP","other_name_zh":"对比语言-图像预训练","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"clip","other_summary":"用对比学习判断图文是否配对的双编码器预训练方法。","rationale":"CLIP 靠图文配对，标题盖不住像素结构。DINOv2 只从图像做自监督，得到可冻结使用的特征。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"DINOv2: Learning Robust Visual Features without Supervision","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.07193"}],"type":"alternative_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:16:06.170012+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m5kc4dgyxfxk089n","other_id":"n_01m5eh84stpd9syvy2","other_kind":"organization","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Meta AI","other_name_zh":null